WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:08.383
I’ve written a film that’s
been honored here

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:10.552
about a boy who 
watched movies

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:13.179
in a north Belfast 
working-class household,

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:16.141
including seeing 
the Oscar ceremony

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:20.186
beamed to the north of Ireland,
and that same story is taking

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.438
me back to the real place.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.148
But this time I'm
seeing it from the stage,

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:25.358
not from my front room
on television.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:28.695
So that is an idea to really 
get your head around.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.905
Enjoy everything. 
Enjoy this moment. 

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:32.866
Enjoy watching movies, 
which I did.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.827
Part of what happened in Belfast
is you got a chance

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:39.247
to put your love for the
 movies and your love

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:41.041
for the place
that you came from,

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.418
where you started
watching movies

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:44.294
on the screen,

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.588
you put your heart there
and you put your instinct there.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.590
You wrote it 
because you had to.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.175
So I'd say to my younger self,

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:52.969
just try and do all the things
you need to do,

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:55.346
all the stories you have 
to tell or try and tell

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:56.514
because they're the best ones.

